name: Link Analysis crypto laundering showcase
tagline: "A seeded crypto laundering Link Analysis demo - a peel chain from a hacked wallet, a mixer hop matched by timing and amount and 40 exchange accounts cashing out one cluster's funds, planted among 10 900 invented addresses with benign look-alikes"
description: "The crypto laundering Link Analysis demo as a Space Template, Basic tier, for compliance at a virtual-asset service provider and investigators. Six synthetic feeds (wallet, transfer, cluster_hint, exchange_account, kyc_person, cashout; 12 months landed from 2025-10-01 in data/inbox, the next month in data/staged; 10 900 addresses in an invented syn1 format that cannot match a real chain, 44 500 transfers in the invented assets SYC and SUSD, 3 150 accounts at five invented exchanges) are landed by six Collectors and Pipelines. The crypto_links Job folds them into ONE link Dataset (src, dst, kind, ts, amount, event_date, via) of six link kinds; the crypto_screen_links Job derives the three screens the saved views read. Planted stories (ground truth: tools/gen-la-crypto-data.ground-truth.json; pinned by CryptoLinksJobGoldenTest and tools/gen-la-crypto-data.test.mjs): 412.5 SYC stolen from a hacked wallet in one transfer and moved down an 80-hop peel chain that peels small amounts into 6 exchange deposit addresses; three lots that go through a mixer and come out within 2 hours at 98-99 % of the input, to one exchange account; one common-input cluster paying 40 exchange accounts in unrelated names that all cash out to the same 3 bank accounts. Benign look-alikes that must not join a story: a company payroll wallet whose month-end run has the same chain shape, mixer users with near-miss exits, and an over-the-counter desk paying its customers' own accounts. Three saved views. Runs on every edition, Basic included: no sign-in personas, Alert Rules or Investigations. Synthetic data only."
minEdition: basic
icon: heroicons_outline:link
contents[5]: "6 Collectors + Pipelines + Datasets (12 months landed, 1 month staged)", "crypto_links Job + Dataset (6 link kinds, via) and the crypto_screen_links Dataset of three screens", "3 saved views (hack peel chain, mixer hop timing match, converging cash-out)", "3 planted stories with benign look-alikes", "Ground truth and golden tests in the repository"
